DESCRIPTION:Happy Holidays Breakfast At this special Holiday NECC Breakfas
 t\, attendees will have the opportunity to network\, take part in an engag
 ing presentation\, introduce themselves to the group\, donate to the Human
  Needs Food Pantry\, and enjoy a hot breakfast at the Cloverleaf Tavern. B
 reakfast will include: Soft scramble with cheddar and chives\, applewood b
 acon and sausage\, roasted potatoes\, cinnamon french toast bake\, and fre
 sh fruit. Sponsorships are available. The program for this event will be: 
 The Partnership Advantage Strong partnerships can help businesses reach ne
 w audiences\, create opportunities\, and grow. Drawing on The Traveling Di
 ary and the Montclair Community Time Capsule\, I’ll share practical less
 ons on building collaborations that serve everyone involved\, along with a
  tip on developing mentoring relationships. About Kyra Peralte Kyra Peralt
 e is a product manager and founder of The Traveling Diary\, a global story
 telling venture with more than 2\,000 members across 33 countries. 
